 *	interp's result.
 *
 * Side effects:
 *	If part1ptr and part2Ptr indicate a local or global variable in
 *	interp, it is deleted. If part1Ptr is an array name and part2Ptr is
 *	NULL, then the whole array is deleted.
 *
